   "when": "Thu 19 Nov · Nasdaq",
   "what": "Anthropic priced at $83 a share, above its first range of $70 to $78. It opened at $111.50, about 34% higher, then eased to near $99. The valuation was about $2 trillion. Including a $26 billion private placement, the total raised exceeds $107 billion, a record. Its compute commitments are nearly $900 billion. The main indexes still ended sharply lower.",
